      "role": "user",
      "content": "## Problem\n\nRead n then n integers. Return the integers sorted in ascending order, separated by single spaces, followed by a newline.\n\nImplement solution(input_str). Return a plain string for every valid input, not only these examples.\n\n## Example tests\n```python\nassert solution('7\\n-3 -18 16 -18 -16 15 -6\\n') == '-18 -18 -16 -6 -3 15 16\\n'\nassert solution('7\\n-8 -6 -16 -17 20 19 4\\n') == '-17 -16 -8 -6 4 19 20\\n'\nassert solution('12\\n3 2 14 9 11 9 -12 1 -4 -11 17 16\\n') == '-12 -11 -4 1 2 3 9 9 11 14 16 17\\n'\n```\nThere are additional unshown inputs.\n\nOutput your solution in a Python code block."
    }
  ],
